WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 7=

01:40.700 --> 01:41.680
He got here this morning.

01:41.820 --> 01:43.060
No way he just got here.

01:43.540 --> 01:44.940
He still has his wine out.

01:45.140 --> 01:45.900
You have to

01:45.980 --> 01:47.100
hand it to our boss.

01:47.980 --> 01:49.180
Then, where is Ms. Lin?

01:49.800 --> 01:50.700
- Ms. Lin.
- Ms. Lin.

01:50.711 --> 01:51.644
- Ms. Lin.
- Ms. Lin.

01:52.740 --> 01:53.610
Look at him.

01:53.610 --> 01:54.933
- See that?
- Time for work.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.620
Morning, Ms. Lin.

01:55.620 --> 01:56.790
- Ms. Lin.
- Morning, Ms. Lin.

01:57.060 --> 01:58.320
- Back to work.
- Back to work.

02:13.222 --> 02:14.488
Why are you sleeping here?

02:14.940 --> 02:16.100
Why can't I sleep here?

02:16.500 --> 02:17.980
I bought this sofa, you know.

02:21.300 --> 02:21.980
What's up?

02:22.300 --> 02:23.500
Did you sleep? Did you go home?

02:23.740 --> 02:24.780
Go home and get some rest.

02:25.100 --> 02:26.380
She talked with me all night.

02:27.933 --> 02:29.590
I was working late,
and He Han came up...

02:29.600 --> 02:30.511
No need to explain.

02:30.940 --> 02:32.355
Just go. I need to get to work.

02:34.980 --> 02:36.244
I can't leave, Lin Zhanqiao.

02:36.340 --> 02:37.022
Listen to me.

02:37.180 --> 02:38.020
Do me a favor.

02:38.420 --> 02:38.860
What is it?

02:40.580 --> 02:41.980
Mimi has me cornered at my hotel.

02:42.420 --> 02:43.500
Come back with me.

02:43.740 --> 02:44.860
If she sees us together,

02:44.860 --> 02:45.620
she'll finally

02:45.620 --> 02:46.580
leave me alone.

02:46.860 --> 02:47.980
You created this mess,

02:47.980 --> 02:49.020
so clean it up yourself.

02:49.500 --> 02:50.020
I'm busy.

02:51.044 --> 02:52.660
So you'll leave me hanging,
Lin Zhanqiao?

02:53.260 --> 02:53.980
I was never loyal.

02:57.940 --> 02:59.533
Zhangzhu,
how about you come with me?

03:06.900 --> 03:07.580
Not a chance.

03:08.300 --> 03:09.100
Go home and rest up.

03:09.100 --> 03:10.470
Take the morning off.
Get some sleep.

03:10.488 --> 03:11.222
Thanks, Ms. Lin.

03:11.620 --> 03:11.980
Coffee.

03:12.100 --> 03:12.500
No thanks.

03:17.340 --> 03:17.740
What?

03:18.460 --> 03:19.333
Need a private chat?

03:21.580 --> 03:22.940
Do you remember the lore book

03:23.155 --> 03:24.533
for "Drunk Old Friend"?

03:25.500 --> 03:25.980
Of course.

03:26.180 --> 03:26.955
I threw it away.

03:27.980 --> 03:29.100
If you still have it,

03:29.620 --> 03:30.300
give it back.

03:31.688 --> 03:32.844
Have you forgotten?

03:33.180 --> 03:34.940
Someone plagiarized the Guazhou section,

03:34.940 --> 03:36.222
which is why we threw it away.

03:36.340 --> 03:36.740
Why?

03:37.177 --> 03:38.180
Is Gu Yan writing it now?

03:39.020 --> 03:40.420
He can't go through Guazhou.

03:40.420 --> 03:41.620
Take Zhichi Gorge instead.

03:41.700 --> 03:42.900
That's none of your business.

03:43.740 --> 03:45.420
The copyright for all project materials

03:45.540 --> 03:46.500
belongs to Chenxing.

03:47.020 --> 03:47.900
If you still have it,

03:48.100 --> 03:49.100
you should return it.

03:49.844 --> 03:50.900
Of course, you could say

03:51.140 --> 03:51.820
you lost it.

03:52.340 --> 03:53.155
Then, forget it.

03:54.780 --> 03:56.020
Still insisting on Guazhou?

03:56.100 --> 03:57.260
Fine. Very ambitious.

03:59.740 --> 04:00.780
I'll go back and look.

04:00.911 --> 04:02.140
If I find it, it's yours.

04:02.220 --> 04:03.700
It's useless to me anyway.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.577
Your dad's birthday is coming up.

04:10.660 --> 04:12.400
How are you celebrating?
Is your mom going?

04:16.940 --> 04:18.100
You're resuming updates soon.

04:18.940 --> 04:19.740
Are you ready?

04:21.260 --> 04:21.940
What if you lose

04:22.140 --> 04:23.010
to Gu Yan

04:23.010 --> 04:24.540
or Hong Qigong

04:24.800 --> 04:25.911
on the charts?

04:26.900 --> 04:28.020
I'll contact your dad.

04:28.140 --> 04:28.800
See you then.

04:29.340 --> 04:30.820
Is the breakup with Mimi sorted?

04:31.260 --> 04:31.900
Don't be late.

04:45.780 --> 04:46.620
See? I didn't lie.

04:47.420 --> 04:48.420
This apartment

04:48.820 --> 04:50.540
is the best unit in the building.

04:51.340 --> 04:52.220
The natural light,

04:53.620 --> 04:55.540
the decor, and the appliances

04:55.540 --> 04:56.580
are all top-tier.

04:57.500 --> 04:59.580
Your rent offer is way too low.

05:00.220 --> 05:01.940
It's hard to rent places out now.

05:02.940 --> 05:03.780
If you use an agent,

05:04.540 --> 05:06.180
they'll charge you a fee.

05:08.580 --> 05:11.060
If you love this building so much,

05:11.140 --> 05:12.020
how about I show you

05:12.260 --> 05:14.220
the smaller unit next door?

05:14.980 --> 05:16.180
It's also for rent.

05:16.340 --> 05:17.380
It's a one-bedroom?

05:20.220 --> 05:20.660
Too small.

05:22.140 --> 05:23.100
You live alone.

05:23.100 --> 05:24.220
How much space do you need?

05:27.888 --> 05:28.860
Is there someone else?

05:31.420 --> 05:33.140
Then, I can't rent to you.

05:33.540 --> 05:34.980
Even though

05:34.980 --> 05:36.180
I'm over you,

05:36.660 --> 05:38.420
if another man

05:38.420 --> 05:39.700
stays in my apartment,

05:40.340 --> 05:41.020
well...

05:41.900 --> 05:43.260
I'm paying rent.

05:43.700 --> 05:45.140
You're paying too little.

05:47.044 --> 05:48.770
You taking advantage of me is one thing.

05:48.770 --> 05:50.100
But another man, too?

05:50.460 --> 05:51.260
No way.

05:53.580 --> 05:54.260
It's settled.

05:54.260 --> 05:55.180
15,000 yuan a month.

05:55.860 --> 05:56.540
I'll live alone.

05:58.620 --> 05:59.580
If there's someone else?

05:59.900 --> 06:01.020
10,000 yuan per person.

06:04.980 --> 06:05.420
Deal.

06:11.940 --> 06:12.340
Hello.

06:28.020 --> 06:28.540
Dai Shan.

06:41.420 --> 06:42.660
I told him early on.

06:42.860 --> 06:45.020
A harem plot
in this chapter is dangerous.

06:45.700 --> 06:46.460
He didn't listen.

06:47.020 --> 06:47.844
Look at him now.

06:48.300 --> 06:49.420
His stats are tanking,

06:49.420 --> 06:50.540
and fans are angry.

06:51.260 --> 06:52.420
He comes to drink every day.

06:52.500 --> 06:53.900
He calls me when he's drunk,

06:54.100 --> 06:55.180
and vents for three hours.

06:55.660 --> 06:56.620
Says he needs to talk.

06:59.540 --> 07:00.620
I'm not an editor anymore.

07:01.140 --> 07:03.460
I'm his personal relationship guru.

07:03.940 --> 07:04.900
I think it's nice.

07:04.900 --> 07:05.900
He talks to you.

07:07.220 --> 07:08.044
I need to take this.

07:09.300 --> 07:09.900
(Ladies,)

07:10.620 --> 07:12.220
(stubbornly chasing a jerk)

07:12.220 --> 07:14.300
(means you lack self-respect.)

07:16.460 --> 07:17.100
(Sometimes,)

07:17.100 --> 07:19.220
(we can't help but reach out.)

07:19.700 --> 07:21.100
(Because we still love him.)

07:21.100 --> 07:22.500
(Because we haven't woken up.)

07:23.660 --> 07:25.860
(But after all the begging,)

07:25.860 --> 07:27.100
(pleading, and crying,)

07:27.460 --> 07:28.620
(in the end...)

07:30.660 --> 07:32.180
(He already has someone new.)

07:34.460 --> 07:36.540
(And it's someone he met at work.)

07:37.740 --> 07:39.140
(They've been together a while.)

07:39.380 --> 07:41.100
(And they never really ended it.)

07:42.580 --> 07:44.020
(Who is this person?)

07:45.940 --> 07:47.500
(I'll reveal it in my novel.)

07:47.620 --> 07:49.060
Met through work,

07:49.340 --> 07:50.580
and already together?

07:51.180 --> 07:52.180
It has to be Ms. Lin.

07:52.620 --> 07:54.780
Did He Han
and Ms. Lin stay together?

07:55.377 --> 07:56.300
Didn't they break up?

07:56.860 --> 07:58.100
Maybe they got back together.

07:59.260 --> 08:00.900
They are soulmates.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.355
The kind that are intertwined.

08:02.377 --> 08:03.220
You wouldn't get it.

08:03.260 --> 08:04.700
Do you believe everything you hear?

08:05.020 --> 08:06.660
What soul sees us as partners?

08:07.620 --> 08:08.620
Are you the love expert?

08:09.180 --> 08:10.580
Tell your authors to intertwine

08:10.580 --> 08:12.180
their male and female leads, then.

08:12.540 --> 08:13.260
Stop letting them

08:13.260 --> 08:14.620
stare longingly from afar.

08:15.140 --> 08:16.380
No one will read that!

08:25.700 --> 08:26.650
In a rush?

08:26.650 --> 08:27.260
Are you...

08:27.540 --> 08:28.980
I'm turning the place upside down.

08:28.980 --> 08:30.020
I can't find it.

08:30.180 --> 08:31.420
I'm not talking about that.

08:32.460 --> 08:33.500
I told you,

08:33.500 --> 08:35.460
don't drag me into Mimi's mess.

08:35.740 --> 08:36.660
What does she want?

08:37.020 --> 08:37.700
True stories?

08:37.860 --> 08:38.500
Live updates?

08:38.500 --> 08:39.700
Old loves and new flames?

08:40.900 --> 08:41.420
Listen up!

08:41.420 --> 08:42.820
If she dares to write about me,

08:43.220 --> 08:44.140
or makes up lies

08:44.140 --> 08:45.500
about us reconciling,

08:45.660 --> 08:46.940
to get clicks and reads,

08:46.940 --> 08:47.890
I can sue her!

08:47.890 --> 08:48.820
And I'll sue you, too!

08:52.700 --> 08:54.060
I didn't provoke her.

08:54.220 --> 08:55.580
We already broke up.

08:55.660 --> 08:57.300
She always twists my words.

08:58.060 --> 08:58.900
Lin Zhanqiao, listen.

08:59.420 --> 09:00.666
The truth speaks for itself.

09:01.500 --> 09:02.780
Whatever she wants to say,

09:02.780 --> 09:03.820
just let her say it.

09:03.940 --> 09:05.850
If this stops you
from getting a new boyfriend,

09:05.850 --> 09:06.410
let me know.

09:06.410 --> 09:08.020
I'll talk to him for you.

09:08.020 --> 09:08.990
I'm done talking to you!

09:09.020 --> 09:10.000
It's making it worse!

09:15.620 --> 09:15.980
Zhangzhu.

09:24.340 --> 09:25.980
You gave her time off, so she went home.

09:27.260 --> 09:27.940
Do me a favor.

09:28.140 --> 09:29.060
Contact Dingqi.

09:29.660 --> 09:30.220
Tell them

09:30.500 --> 09:32.088
to make Mimi delete that smear video.

09:32.260 --> 09:33.088
Right, Ms. Lin.

09:36.260 --> 09:36.820
Good news.

09:36.888 --> 09:38.300
Ms. Wu from Zhiyuan Investment

09:38.300 --> 09:39.955
wants to see you this afternoon.

09:41.740 --> 09:42.290
Tell her

09:42.290 --> 09:43.288
I'll see her at 2 PM.

09:43.340 --> 09:43.700
Also,

09:43.900 --> 09:44.450
tell Gu Yan

09:44.450 --> 09:45.130
not to come today.

09:45.130 --> 09:45.500
Okay.

09:46.060 --> 09:46.460
Sir.

09:46.860 --> 09:47.540
You can't go in.

09:48.940 --> 09:49.660
Sir!

09:50.820 --> 09:51.660
Please wait a moment.

10:05.420 --> 10:05.930
Sir!

10:05.930 --> 10:06.780
You can't come in.

10:07.260 --> 10:07.620
Ms. Lin.

10:08.020 --> 10:09.555
Zhangzhu's father is here to see you.

10:12.260 --> 10:13.340
You're Zhangzhu's boss?

10:14.540 --> 10:15.180
Lin Zhanqiao,

10:15.540 --> 10:16.460
head of Chenxing.

10:20.300 --> 10:21.220
You owe me an apology.

10:21.500 --> 10:21.940
Who is he?

10:22.460 --> 10:22.980
I don't know.

10:23.220 --> 10:23.980
I think it's

10:24.620 --> 10:25.340
Zhangzhu's dad.

10:27.180 --> 10:27.700
For what?

10:30.260 --> 10:30.900
How old are you?

10:36.220 --> 10:37.420
You're clearly not a child.

10:40.180 --> 10:41.660
My daughter is only twenty-two.

10:42.620 --> 10:45.380
You need to apologize
for filling her head

10:45.460 --> 10:46.260
with terrible ideas.

10:49.020 --> 10:50.770
What terrible ideas did I teach her?

10:50.770 --> 10:52.733
Encouraging her
not to call my new wife Mom.

10:54.260 --> 10:55.860
That she has the right to accept

10:56.340 --> 10:57.170
this new mother,

10:57.170 --> 10:58.500
and the right to reject her.

10:59.700 --> 11:00.380
"Our home

11:00.688 --> 11:01.844
is her father's home."

11:01.860 --> 11:02.740
"It isn't her home."

11:03.540 --> 11:04.333
"Live elsewhere"

11:04.500 --> 11:05.420
"under another's roof."

11:06.380 --> 11:08.540
"She deserves
a real home of her own."

11:10.020 --> 11:11.660
What kind of boss are you?

11:12.220 --> 11:14.220
Aren't you overstepping?

11:15.380 --> 11:16.570
She comes here to work,

11:16.570 --> 11:17.860
not to be brainwashed.

11:18.660 --> 11:20.100
You seem educated.

11:20.660 --> 11:21.940
You should know better than me,

11:22.260 --> 11:23.500
that the most important quality

11:23.860 --> 11:25.020
is filial piety.

11:25.380 --> 11:25.740
Right?

11:28.380 --> 11:28.900
First of all,

11:29.700 --> 11:31.140
I never said that to Zhangzhu.

11:31.140 --> 11:32.540
If not you, then who?

11:32.740 --> 11:33.820
Are there other bosses?

11:34.860 --> 11:35.820
It's this place.

11:36.180 --> 11:37.250
You're ruining my daughter.

11:37.250 --> 11:37.660
Second,

11:38.466 --> 11:39.620
I had never met you before.

11:40.860 --> 11:42.050
And I just found out

11:42.050 --> 11:42.980
your new wife would be

11:43.100 --> 11:44.220
Zhangzhu's new mother.

11:44.900 --> 11:46.140
I would've said the same

11:46.220 --> 11:46.980
had she asked me.

11:47.340 --> 11:49.220
I don't see anything wrong with it.

11:50.300 --> 11:51.540
Zhangzhu is twenty-two.

11:51.540 --> 11:52.580
She's not twelve.

11:53.180 --> 11:54.100
She is your daughter.

11:54.300 --> 11:55.140
But she is also

11:55.140 --> 11:56.860
an independent adult.

11:57.222 --> 11:58.420
She deserves your respect.

11:59.820 --> 12:00.580
Let me tell you.

12:01.540 --> 12:02.780
I do not allow my daughter

12:02.780 --> 12:03.860
to keep working here.

12:05.020 --> 12:06.140
Then please ask

12:06.140 --> 12:07.219
your daughter's opinion.

12:07.220 --> 12:08.580
And respect her decision.

12:11.660 --> 12:12.780
I can't talk to you.

12:13.540 --> 12:14.060
Ms. Liu.

12:14.140 --> 12:14.740
It's Ms. Lin.

12:26.460 --> 12:27.180
Let's go.

12:42.380 --> 12:42.900
What?

12:43.420 --> 12:45.020
Was calling not personal enough?

12:45.100 --> 12:46.220
You had to come in person?

12:46.380 --> 12:46.980
Let me ask you.

12:48.260 --> 12:49.340
What did you tell Zhangzhu?

12:50.300 --> 12:51.220
Her dad just came here

12:51.220 --> 12:52.660
and chewed me out!

12:52.980 --> 12:54.940
He went to your office
and chewed you out?

12:55.100 --> 12:56.660
Doesn't that prove I was right?

12:56.660 --> 12:57.620
Her dad is the problem.

12:57.980 --> 12:59.260
Zhangzhu is my assistant.

12:59.700 --> 13:00.540
I finally found

13:00.540 --> 13:01.660
a competent assistant.

13:01.844 --> 13:03.100
Your late-night talk with her

13:03.100 --> 13:04.340
could've made her quit!

13:04.540 --> 13:05.933
Can you get me a new one, then?

13:07.020 --> 13:07.700
Before you speak,

13:07.700 --> 13:09.500
use your brain
and think of the consequences!

13:09.660 --> 13:10.020
Hold on.

13:10.460 --> 13:12.220
Who could've seen this coming?

13:12.540 --> 13:13.260
Right?

13:13.900 --> 13:15.020
You know what I said.

13:15.020 --> 13:16.290
So you must agree with me.

13:16.290 --> 13:17.700
You probably even admire me.

13:18.100 --> 13:19.340
You're pretending to be mad.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.140
I can tell.

13:20.540 --> 13:21.300
But I have to say,

13:21.660 --> 13:22.420
Zhangzhu is a

13:22.420 --> 13:23.820
smart girl who knows what's right.

13:24.140 --> 13:25.260
Is she back at the office?

13:25.780 --> 13:26.740
She's my assistant.

13:26.740 --> 13:27.660
If anything comes up,

13:27.660 --> 13:28.780
I can handle it.

13:28.940 --> 13:29.620
Why don't you

13:29.620 --> 13:30.900
go talk to her dad?

13:31.380 --> 13:32.420
Stop running your mouth

13:32.420 --> 13:33.820
and blaming me, okay?

13:33.911 --> 13:34.780
Yes, you're not busy.

13:34.780 --> 13:35.740
You can ride your bike.

13:35.740 --> 13:37.420
But I can't. I have to work!

13:37.500 --> 13:38.300
I'm working, too.

13:38.300 --> 13:39.500
I'm looking for the lore book.

13:39.740 --> 13:40.620
If you have time,

13:40.620 --> 13:41.940
we can sit down and review it.

13:41.940 --> 13:43.340
We can probably figure it out.

13:43.660 --> 13:44.260
I'm busy.

13:50.580 --> 13:51.700
It's expensive.

14:18.220 --> 14:18.980
Your boss is here.

14:19.620 --> 14:20.460
Sorry, Ms. Lin.

14:20.820 --> 14:21.740
Give me a second.

14:21.980 --> 14:22.420
It's fine.

14:22.700 --> 14:24.020
I'm heading back to the office.

14:24.340 --> 14:25.100
I'll contact you.

14:25.180 --> 14:26.660
Just give me five minutes!

14:27.100 --> 14:27.660
No rush.

14:27.940 --> 14:29.420
Finish today's work first.

14:29.780 --> 14:31.460
We can deal
with the Guazhou arc later.

14:31.780 --> 14:32.355
I'm leaving.

14:37.780 --> 14:38.300
What's wrong?

14:40.980 --> 14:42.860
Ms. Lin shouldn't see us like this.

14:44.500 --> 14:45.740
Isn't this normal?

14:55.660 --> 14:56.580
Mei, where are you?

15:05.700 --> 15:07.460
Didn't you know Gu Yan had a girlfriend?

15:08.380 --> 15:09.460
I knew.

15:09.860 --> 15:11.355
Then, why are you freaking out?

15:12.980 --> 15:14.580
I wasn't prepared for it.

15:15.740 --> 15:17.540
I used to visit He Han like this.

15:17.660 --> 15:19.020
And I never ran into

15:19.020 --> 15:20.300
such an awkward situation.

15:21.820 --> 15:23.380
He Han was your boyfriend.

15:23.700 --> 15:24.460
Gu Yan isn't.

15:24.644 --> 15:25.660
Back then, He Han and I

15:25.660 --> 15:26.900
weren't even dating.

15:27.340 --> 15:28.580
We just met,

15:28.580 --> 15:29.380
and worked together.

15:29.620 --> 15:31.420
Nothing like this ever happened.

15:32.220 --> 15:33.580
That's because he's experienced,

15:33.580 --> 15:35.020
and hid it from you.

15:35.940 --> 15:37.340
Mimi just dropped a bombshell.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.020
She said He Han is two-timing.

15:40.540 --> 15:41.500
When did this happen?

15:42.340 --> 15:43.340
"Wide Awake"

15:43.340 --> 15:44.260
updated this morning.

15:47.060 --> 15:49.220
(Wide Awake)

15:53.340 --> 15:54.400
Am I that kind of person?

15:54.660 --> 15:55.860
We already broke up.

15:56.180 --> 15:57.020
Why would I go back

15:57.220 --> 15:59.220
to fight a woman like Mimi over He Han?

16:00.500 --> 16:02.220
Even I wouldn't believe it if I said it.

16:09.780 --> 16:10.460
Another update.

16:11.140 --> 16:14.020
The Jerk's Romance
with His Older Manager.

16:20.300 --> 16:23.100
(Chapter 7: The Jerk's Romance
with His Older Manager)

16:23.100 --> 16:23.820
(Ladies,)

16:23.980 --> 16:27.020
(the worst part isn't being cheated on.)

16:27.580 --> 16:29.700
(It's realizing I was the other woman.)

16:31.100 --> 16:33.260
(He was with his manager all along.)

16:33.660 --> 16:34.740
(I was fooled for so long.)

16:34.740 --> 16:36.220
(How could I be so stupid?)

16:38.820 --> 16:41.260
(They are two of a kind.)

16:41.620 --> 16:44.460
I could hear you laughing
from the elevator.

16:44.460 --> 16:45.620
Is it that funny?

16:46.500 --> 16:47.940
How is this not funny?

16:49.020 --> 16:50.700
Lin Zhanqiao thought it was her.

16:50.980 --> 16:53.940
She even went to Dingqi,
demanding they delete the video.

16:54.180 --> 16:56.460
I can just imagine the look on her face.

16:56.460 --> 16:57.660
I never thought

16:58.820 --> 17:00.140
I'd fail so miserably

17:00.140 --> 17:01.580
in love.

17:01.940 --> 17:02.820
Oh my goodness.

17:02.820 --> 17:04.380
What is all this?

17:06.500 --> 17:07.220
Did you do this?

17:07.740 --> 17:09.260
Would she have left otherwise?

17:10.140 --> 17:12.500
You mean you're He Han's new flame?

17:12.940 --> 17:14.340
After he and Lin Zhanqiao broke up,

17:14.340 --> 17:15.420
we got together.

17:16.220 --> 17:17.260
I don't believe it.

17:17.980 --> 17:19.420
You look much older than him.

17:21.940 --> 17:22.820
Listen to me.

17:22.900 --> 17:25.660
This will really help

17:25.660 --> 17:27.340
with tonight's click rates.

17:27.820 --> 17:29.140
What were you going to write?

17:30.580 --> 17:31.620
That his new flame

17:31.620 --> 17:33.260
is another female author?

17:34.060 --> 17:35.980
They could sue you for slander.

17:38.020 --> 17:38.866
Lin Zhanqiao...

17:39.900 --> 17:40.620
Is it original

17:40.780 --> 17:42.140
to rekindle an old flame?

17:42.900 --> 17:43.500
No.

17:43.660 --> 17:45.460
Plus, what chapter

17:45.740 --> 17:46.460
are you even on?

17:46.900 --> 17:49.740
If they get back together now,

17:49.740 --> 17:51.460
what's left to write?

17:52.340 --> 17:53.170
That's why

17:53.170 --> 17:55.700
you have to use my idea.

17:55.820 --> 17:57.180
It perfectly satisfies

17:57.380 --> 17:59.980
their craving for gossip.

18:00.380 --> 18:00.940
Plus,

18:01.460 --> 18:02.740
the jerk persona

18:03.088 --> 18:04.333
is taken to the next level.

18:04.644 --> 18:05.210
I'm serious.

18:05.210 --> 18:06.900
This is pure genius.

18:07.060 --> 18:07.980
Never mind Mimi.

18:08.220 --> 18:09.780
Even I'm in awe.

18:10.260 --> 18:11.700
Come on. Sit down.

18:12.980 --> 18:14.130
Absolutely brilliant.

18:14.130 --> 18:15.060
A total masterpiece.

18:16.780 --> 18:17.780
She just wanted

18:17.780 --> 18:19.860
to milk you for content.

18:19.980 --> 18:21.580
So I taught her a lesson.

18:25.420 --> 18:26.780
I can never repay you.

18:27.020 --> 18:28.380
Except with my body.

18:28.660 --> 18:29.340
I may flirt

18:29.340 --> 18:30.940
with young girls.

18:31.180 --> 18:32.133
But it means nothing.

18:32.180 --> 18:33.500
I actually value brains.

18:33.577 --> 18:34.460
With a mind like yours,

18:34.580 --> 18:35.700
age is just a number.

18:41.860 --> 18:43.580
I'm not interested in younger men.

18:44.180 --> 18:45.540
I only want your drafts.

18:45.780 --> 18:47.660
Save your brains and everything else

18:48.060 --> 18:49.180
for the other girls.

18:53.340 --> 18:54.460
You really won't consider it?

18:58.460 --> 19:00.020
You like older men.

19:00.300 --> 19:01.420
How old is Mr. Fan?

19:01.540 --> 19:02.700
He's got to be eighty-five.

19:03.020 --> 19:04.100
Isn't that too old?

19:04.300 --> 19:06.620
Twenty-year-olds
probably think you're old, too.

19:07.260 --> 19:08.740
But you don't mind, do you?

19:08.940 --> 19:09.660
Fair point.

19:10.260 --> 19:11.740
I should hit the gym more.

19:15.260 --> 19:15.660
Catch.

19:18.500 --> 19:19.444
Take it for a spin.

19:20.620 --> 19:22.220
Thanks, boss.

19:22.220 --> 19:23.060
Don't mention it.

19:23.740 --> 19:24.980
Being generous to my girlfriend

19:25.060 --> 19:26.660
only makes me look good.

19:31.660 --> 19:32.260
Tell me,

19:33.220 --> 19:34.660
is it true about him and Dai Shan?

19:35.260 --> 19:36.377
Find it hard to believe?

19:36.977 --> 19:37.780
You'd rather believe

19:37.780 --> 19:39.140
he's with Mimi or Jia Jia?

19:43.980 --> 19:44.900
Dai Shan

19:45.180 --> 19:46.820
is Mr. Fan's ex-wife.

19:47.220 --> 19:47.900
So what?

19:51.100 --> 19:52.740
Can you take your calls outside?

19:53.266 --> 19:53.940
Taking it here

19:53.940 --> 19:55.340
disturbs everyone else.

19:55.540 --> 19:56.780
You think you're the sun?

19:56.933 --> 19:58.250
That we all revolve around you?

19:58.250 --> 19:59.370
You only care about dating.

19:59.370 --> 20:01.010
Does dating make us money?

20:01.010 --> 20:02.020
What are you waiting for?

20:02.020 --> 20:02.860
Hurry up and fix it.

20:02.940 --> 20:03.820
Send out a notice.

20:04.300 --> 20:06.580
Editors and authors cannot date.

20:06.860 --> 20:07.820
Otherwise, how can they

20:07.820 --> 20:08.620
stay objective?

20:09.177 --> 20:09.977
Understood, Mr. Fan.

20:10.300 --> 20:12.700
I hate people
who can't separate work and life.

20:16.500 --> 20:17.500
What is it, Fan?

20:17.980 --> 20:19.860
Are you serious about He Han?

20:20.540 --> 20:22.540
He is my top author.

20:23.020 --> 20:24.300
Even so, I don't want him

20:24.300 --> 20:25.900
to live in my apartment.

20:27.340 --> 20:27.980
I hope

20:28.100 --> 20:29.900
you remember your promise to me.

20:30.980 --> 20:31.940
Fine. Don't worry.

20:32.660 --> 20:33.820
I won't let him come over.

20:35.420 --> 20:37.220
"Shattered Six States" is relaunching.

20:37.860 --> 20:40.060
You promised me prime promotion spots.

20:40.180 --> 20:41.740
You'd better remember your promise, too.

20:42.540 --> 20:43.460
I'm driving. Bye.

20:50.340 --> 20:51.780
I think this judge is great.

20:52.540 --> 20:53.620
Is it true, Ms. Lin?

20:54.260 --> 20:55.860
How would I know if it's true?

20:56.460 --> 20:57.500
Go ask He Han yourself.

20:57.660 --> 20:58.660
You have his number.

20:58.820 --> 20:59.820
I meant Guazhou.

21:01.260 --> 21:03.500
Are we really writing them into Guazhou?

21:07.580 --> 21:08.860
Isn't it drafted and uploaded?

21:09.280 --> 21:11.200
On Monday,
"Drunk Old Friend" enters Guazhou.

21:11.210 --> 21:12.910
He Han's
"Shattered Six States" relaunches.

21:12.977 --> 21:14.660
If we make such huge plot changes now,

21:14.820 --> 21:15.940
we could lose readers.

21:20.180 --> 21:20.860
I'm confident.

21:21.500 --> 21:22.380
Once it's published,

21:22.380 --> 21:23.400
there's no turning back.

21:23.488 --> 21:24.380
If the readers hate it,

21:24.380 --> 21:25.220
we're done for.

21:26.700 --> 21:27.900
I sent it to the website.

21:28.220 --> 21:28.900
Stop asking.

21:29.311 --> 21:31.140
Prepare the next batch
of lore for He Han.

21:35.820 --> 21:36.380
For Gu Yan.

21:44.500 --> 21:47.340
(He Han)

21:57.060 --> 21:57.460
Hello?

21:59.020 --> 22:00.620
Flattering yourself, aren't you?

22:01.660 --> 22:03.500
Regret blowing up at me earlier,

22:03.500 --> 22:04.100
don't you?

22:04.980 --> 22:05.660
I'm sorry.

22:07.620 --> 22:08.660
I misunderstood you.

22:09.180 --> 22:09.860
It's fine.

22:10.140 --> 22:11.260
I'll be the bigger person.

22:11.500 --> 22:13.020
It's all water under the bridge.

22:13.980 --> 22:15.260
But I'm calling to ask,

22:16.020 --> 22:16.980
how is Zhangzhu?

22:17.380 --> 22:19.220
Did her dad
really stop her from working?

22:19.940 --> 22:21.660
If so, I need to talk to him.

22:22.020 --> 22:23.220
She's my number one fan.

22:23.220 --> 22:24.220
I'm responsible for her.

22:24.380 --> 22:25.444
I haven't contacted her.

22:26.180 --> 22:27.300
Even if something happened,

22:27.300 --> 22:28.620
it's not your place to see him.

22:29.300 --> 22:30.780
I'm her boss. I'll handle it.

22:31.020 --> 22:32.340
Fine, you handle it.

22:32.420 --> 22:33.780
If you can't, come to me.

22:35.660 --> 22:37.220
By the way, I'll drop by tomorrow.

22:37.780 --> 22:38.300
See you.

22:53.930 --> 22:57.511
♪I watch stars in my eyes♪

22:57.511 --> 23:00.644
♪Slowly tripped away♪

23:02.044 --> 23:05.109
♪I don't know it inside last night♪

23:05.110 --> 23:08.555
♪Cause I never see you again♪

23:09.688 --> 23:13.459
♪I'm waking up
to silence in the morning♪

23:13.460 --> 23:17.222
♪Heal, can I heal?♪

23:17.933 --> 23:21.239
♪All I want is nothing but♪

23:21.240 --> 23:24.488
♪Better see your face someday♪

23:25.133 --> 23:29.259
♪All I wish that you
could hear my voice♪

23:29.260 --> 23:34.155
♪And know that I won't forget you♪

23:34.622 --> 23:37.355
♪Never forget you♪

24:02.020 --> 24:02.700
What is this?

24:04.860 --> 24:05.620
About today...

24:06.220 --> 24:06.860
I'm sorry.

24:07.580 --> 24:08.660
I told San Mei

24:08.660 --> 24:09.580
not to come anymore.

24:10.140 --> 24:11.460
From now on, that's my workspace.

24:11.780 --> 24:12.980
You can check on me anytime.

24:13.940 --> 24:15.980
I shouldn't make you feel uncomfortable.

24:18.940 --> 24:20.180
Put this back and keep it safe.

24:20.700 --> 24:21.780
Who locks their girlfriend

24:21.780 --> 24:22.820
out of a room?

24:24.900 --> 24:26.420
You weren't replying to my messages.

24:27.060 --> 24:28.260
I thought you were mad.

24:30.140 --> 24:31.660
I was in a meeting with Zhiyuan.

24:32.060 --> 24:32.380
Right.

24:33.580 --> 24:34.580
I have good news.

24:35.620 --> 24:37.300
Zhiyuan agreed to invest.

24:38.860 --> 24:39.940
But I was also mad.

24:40.820 --> 24:41.860
Not because

24:41.860 --> 24:43.300
San Mei was in your room.

24:43.620 --> 24:45.100
That's your business.

24:45.980 --> 24:48.060
It's because you game all night.

24:48.380 --> 24:49.340
You write all day,

24:49.420 --> 24:50.580
with zero sleep.

24:51.420 --> 24:52.500
If you keep this up,

24:52.500 --> 24:54.020
it'll ruin your health.

24:56.300 --> 24:58.380
We used to make money gaming.

24:59.140 --> 25:00.100
If I quit,

25:00.500 --> 25:02.020
they'll lose a lot of income.

25:03.340 --> 25:04.420
I can't just abandon them,

25:04.420 --> 25:06.180
just because I can make money

25:06.940 --> 25:07.940
writing online now.

25:08.540 --> 25:09.980
But you can't let loyalty

25:10.340 --> 25:11.460
hold you back like this.

25:33.180 --> 25:33.820
What's wrong?

25:38.300 --> 25:39.900
I think Wang Hai and I are breaking up.

25:40.500 --> 25:41.020
No way.

25:43.580 --> 25:44.660
He's afraid of Lin Zhanqiao.

25:45.222 --> 25:46.500
He took the keys back from me

25:46.500 --> 25:47.820
so Lin Zhanqiao wouldn't be upset.

25:53.580 --> 25:55.580
You know, you're overthinking it.

25:56.220 --> 25:57.460
Lin Zhanqiao is his boss.

25:58.100 --> 25:58.980
Of course he's afraid.

25:59.500 --> 26:00.900
That's not what I mean.

26:01.100 --> 26:02.220
Stop playing dumb.

26:04.780 --> 26:09.500
(Esports Internet Cafe, Arcades)

26:09.500 --> 26:10.177
Let me tell you,

26:10.300 --> 26:11.780
even if he's aiming out of his league,

26:12.022 --> 26:13.420
would Lin Zhanqiao ever go for him?

26:14.020 --> 26:15.500
He's a top author now.

26:15.980 --> 26:17.020
So what?

26:17.940 --> 26:19.380
Lin Zhanqiao just uses him for money.

26:19.620 --> 26:20.540
She'd use anyone.

26:20.955 --> 26:21.820
When it's all over,

26:22.100 --> 26:23.820
won't he just be
a lousy admin here again?

26:24.820 --> 26:25.780
He gets it.

26:31.780 --> 26:32.700
We're at the bottom.

26:33.420 --> 26:34.340
They're at the top.

26:35.020 --> 26:36.020
Two different worlds.

26:36.622 --> 26:37.620
He goes up for a spin,

26:37.666 --> 26:39.900
broadens his horizons,
and comes back to brag to us.

26:39.900 --> 26:40.460
That's enough.

26:41.380 --> 26:42.260
Back to reality.

26:43.220 --> 26:44.860
If he really wants to be their equal,

26:45.088 --> 26:46.820
he should build
good karma in this life,

26:47.220 --> 26:48.688
and hope for a better next life.

26:51.420 --> 26:52.570
He might not think that way.

26:52.570 --> 26:54.140
Slap him twice and he will.

26:54.860 --> 26:56.300
Boss, instant noodles with sausage.

26:56.980 --> 26:57.340
Coming.

26:57.660 --> 26:58.180
It's PC 16.

27:05.500 --> 27:06.020
Ms. Zhou.

27:06.500 --> 27:07.000
Why don't we

27:07.220 --> 27:08.355
add each other on WeChat?

27:08.500 --> 27:09.980
If you want to add Ms. Zhou,

27:09.980 --> 27:11.460
you need Mr. Bei's permission.

27:12.020 --> 27:12.420
Really?

27:12.700 --> 27:14.300
I wouldn't dare make decisions for her.

27:15.340 --> 27:16.666
Come on, let's add each other.

27:17.540 --> 27:18.420
Alright. Mr. Bei,

27:18.860 --> 27:19.620
we're taking off.

27:19.740 --> 27:20.420
- Alright, bye.
- Bye.

27:20.420 --> 27:21.260
- Bye.
- See you.

27:21.340 --> 27:21.660
Bye.

27:32.220 --> 27:32.780
Ms. Zhou.

27:33.820 --> 27:35.660
If you have time tomorrow morning,

27:36.300 --> 27:38.260
let's meet with your mother.

27:38.780 --> 27:39.260
First,

27:39.620 --> 27:40.620
we need to check

27:40.820 --> 27:42.740
the property rights of her current home.

27:43.180 --> 27:43.740
Then,

27:44.060 --> 27:45.740
we need to understand her intent.

27:48.460 --> 27:48.860
Okay.

27:49.260 --> 27:50.100
Thank you, Mr. Bei.

28:31.340 --> 28:32.266
To Three on the Bund.

28:32.340 --> 28:32.660
Okay.

28:37.940 --> 28:39.140
You lucked out today.

28:42.577 --> 28:43.380
What year is this?

28:43.860 --> 28:44.980
It's an 18-year Dalmore.

28:44.980 --> 28:45.380
18 years?

28:46.900 --> 28:47.300
No wonder.

28:47.300 --> 28:48.266
No wonder it's strong.

28:48.444 --> 28:49.600
Really? I'm a bit dizzy, too.

28:50.260 --> 28:51.980
But you aren't flushed. You can drink.

28:52.220 --> 28:53.500
I will be there soon.

28:53.620 --> 28:54.500
You did drink a lot.

28:55.180 --> 28:55.770
It's alright.

28:55.770 --> 28:56.620
Excuse me.

28:57.020 --> 28:58.300
I need a word with Ling Yikai.

28:59.620 --> 29:00.340
Why are you here?

29:01.300 --> 29:01.800
Wait for me.

29:02.460 --> 29:03.020
Okay.

29:03.460 --> 29:04.260
Why the bad mood?

29:10.580 --> 29:11.170
Who is she?

29:11.170 --> 29:11.900
Talking business.

29:12.260 --> 29:13.370
That involves me, too.

29:13.370 --> 29:14.260
Let's talk together.

29:14.740 --> 29:15.380
Listen,

29:15.380 --> 29:17.133
Zhiyuan already
gave the money to Chenxing.

29:17.222 --> 29:18.644
We didn't get a dime, understand?

29:18.780 --> 29:19.380
So?

29:19.540 --> 29:21.580
You came to drown
your sorrows and pick up girls?

29:21.660 --> 29:23.044
If the girl brings in investments,

29:23.088 --> 29:23.977
why wouldn't I?

29:25.580 --> 29:26.700
Stop hovering over me.

29:26.700 --> 29:27.660
Go find some money.

29:29.260 --> 29:30.180
This girl you mentioned

29:30.460 --> 29:30.940
will invest

29:31.180 --> 29:32.620
seven million yuan in us this month.

29:33.244 --> 29:34.155
Can you do that?

29:35.140 --> 29:35.620
Can you?

29:39.155 --> 29:40.180
I'm not playing around.

29:40.180 --> 29:41.100
You said

29:41.666 --> 29:42.780
we'd exchange resources.

29:42.780 --> 29:43.700
You said you're capable

29:43.700 --> 29:44.860
of bringing me huge profits.

29:46.266 --> 29:46.980
If you deliver,

29:47.500 --> 29:48.420
I'll stay by your side.

29:48.466 --> 29:50.300
If you can't,
don't talk to me about feelings.

29:50.300 --> 29:51.620
It means you have no respect

29:51.620 --> 29:52.660
for the rules of our game.

29:53.660 --> 29:55.020
How much did she bring in a month?

29:55.088 --> 29:55.733
Seven million.

29:57.377 --> 29:58.333
I'll get it for you.

29:58.444 --> 29:59.377
In one month?

30:05.340 --> 30:05.660
Here.

30:08.140 --> 30:08.460
What?

30:09.288 --> 30:10.111
Take a photo.

30:12.777 --> 30:13.740
For our seven million.

30:14.100 --> 30:14.540
Come.

30:21.260 --> 30:24.660
(Zhao Lanxin: Party on the Bund)

30:42.740 --> 30:45.380
(Zhiyuan Venture Capital Allocation,
Chenxing Culture Media Co., Ltd.)

30:47.420 --> 30:47.900
Hello?

30:49.500 --> 30:50.740
I got the ginseng you couriered.

30:51.060 --> 30:52.020
You're not coming over?

30:53.620 --> 30:54.660
I'm not going back today.

30:54.660 --> 30:55.933
I'm seeing my mom tomorrow.

30:57.180 --> 30:58.180
Why are you seeing her?

30:59.060 --> 31:01.300
Mr. Bei and I are checking out
her house to figure out

31:01.900 --> 31:02.940
how to talk to my dad.

31:03.340 --> 31:04.170
If all else fails,

31:04.170 --> 31:05.540
we'll take legal action.

31:08.260 --> 31:10.180
Does Mr. Bei know how you act

31:10.180 --> 31:11.100
in front of your mom?

31:11.460 --> 31:11.940
No.

31:12.820 --> 31:13.340
But he knows

31:13.340 --> 31:14.820
she's a very traditional woman.

31:16.820 --> 31:17.777
And your nail polish?

31:18.180 --> 31:19.460
Removing it now.

31:20.700 --> 31:21.511
And your hair?

31:23.180 --> 31:24.820
I'll straighten it tomorrow morning.

31:25.420 --> 31:26.100
Don't worry.

31:26.660 --> 31:28.220
Shoes, bags, and clothes...

31:28.220 --> 31:29.060
It's all prepared.

31:29.260 --> 31:30.220
Armed to the teeth.

31:31.900 --> 31:33.300
Wish your dad a happy birthday.

31:34.260 --> 31:35.820
Tell him to slice the ginseng for tea.

31:37.660 --> 31:38.780
I'll thank you on his behalf.

31:40.100 --> 31:40.666
By the way,

31:40.900 --> 31:42.100
I have good news.

31:43.300 --> 31:44.410
Looks like I'll secure

31:44.410 --> 31:45.580
Zhiyuan's investment.

31:46.700 --> 31:48.820
This finally solves
my immediate problem.

31:50.180 --> 31:51.060
I acted so confidently

31:51.060 --> 31:52.780
at the office every day.

31:53.340 --> 31:55.020
But deep down, I knew

31:55.180 --> 31:56.660
I was almost completely broke.

31:58.340 --> 31:58.940
Thank you.

32:00.100 --> 32:00.500
Alright.

32:00.900 --> 32:02.300
We both have battles tomorrow.

32:02.300 --> 32:03.180
Get some rest.

32:04.180 --> 32:05.020
You too. Bye.

32:14.660 --> 32:17.060
(Property Management Fee Notice)

32:17.060 --> 32:20.500
(Received. Will pay within a month.)

32:40.860 --> 32:42.100
You're not mistaken. It's me.

32:43.044 --> 32:43.711
Let's go.

32:51.980 --> 32:53.260
You suddenly got so serious.

32:53.980 --> 32:54.820
Zhang Yousen and I

32:55.380 --> 32:56.380
aren't quite used to it.

32:57.740 --> 32:58.300
Yeah.

32:58.820 --> 33:00.060
It's a huge change.

33:00.780 --> 33:01.580
May I know

33:01.980 --> 33:03.060
why you dressed like this

33:03.060 --> 33:03.900
to see your mom?

33:04.540 --> 33:05.540
My mom has always

33:06.340 --> 33:07.820
hated flashy women the most.

33:08.660 --> 33:10.220
It's kind of like PTSD.

33:11.220 --> 33:12.740
So I can never let her know

33:13.020 --> 33:14.460
I wear heels and lipstick,

33:14.820 --> 33:15.860
and floral dresses.

33:17.700 --> 33:18.820
But your style...

33:20.140 --> 33:21.860
I mean your actual style.

33:22.220 --> 33:23.100
Does your mom know?

33:23.300 --> 33:23.820
No.

33:26.140 --> 33:28.660
She never let me wear skirts
or leather shoes when I was young.

33:29.940 --> 33:30.980
So when I grew up,

33:31.500 --> 33:32.460
all my money

33:32.980 --> 33:34.620
went to clothes and makeup.

33:35.860 --> 33:37.100
Call it rebellion.

33:37.380 --> 33:38.300
What if

33:38.460 --> 33:39.740
she finds out?

33:41.044 --> 33:42.111
She'll go crazy.

33:47.740 --> 33:49.780
Looks like today's legal consult

33:49.780 --> 33:51.020
just got harder.

34:11.060 --> 34:12.100
Here. Thanks.

34:21.860 --> 34:22.620
Slippers are here.

34:33.940 --> 34:34.420
Thanks.

34:35.460 --> 34:35.860
Thank you.

34:40.020 --> 34:40.820
We're family.

34:41.460 --> 34:42.540
If we can avoid a lawsuit,

34:42.820 --> 34:43.860
we should.

34:44.500 --> 34:45.580
Best to keep

34:45.955 --> 34:47.133
outsiders out of it.

34:47.380 --> 34:49.220
He divorced you over a decade ago.

34:49.540 --> 34:50.340
We aren't family.

34:51.700 --> 34:53.500
Ms. Zhou told me

34:54.180 --> 34:54.740
her father

34:55.060 --> 34:56.340
wants to sell this house,

34:57.020 --> 34:59.540
and split the proceeds equally.

34:59.820 --> 35:00.860
I don't want to sell.

35:01.860 --> 35:03.340
The other woman wants his money.

35:03.900 --> 35:05.300
So he's targeting this house.

35:06.180 --> 35:06.860
Mr. Bei,

35:07.420 --> 35:09.260
if you can make him see

35:09.260 --> 35:11.420
she's just using him,

35:12.820 --> 35:14.860
and he wants to move back temporarily,

35:15.660 --> 35:16.980
I'm open to it.

35:17.100 --> 35:17.620
Mom.

35:18.980 --> 35:20.100
He's not coming back.

35:21.860 --> 35:22.580
Mr. Bei,

35:23.140 --> 35:24.180
you can tell

35:24.460 --> 35:25.380
my daughter and I

35:25.780 --> 35:26.700
are decent people.

35:29.460 --> 35:30.180
She's never

35:30.460 --> 35:31.820
even dated.

35:33.180 --> 35:35.140
How could we possibly

35:35.580 --> 35:37.700
meet with that woman?

35:38.140 --> 35:39.580
I don't want her

35:39.940 --> 35:41.940
to pollute my daughter's mind.

35:43.380 --> 35:44.980
Please meet her

35:45.340 --> 35:46.380
on our behalf.

35:47.140 --> 35:48.260
Tell her

35:48.700 --> 35:49.820
that ruining a marriage

35:50.380 --> 35:51.380
and coveting property

35:51.660 --> 35:53.060
are highly immoral.

35:53.377 --> 35:54.900
There will be serious consequences.

35:55.220 --> 35:55.620
Right?

36:08.380 --> 36:09.100
Mr. Zhang,

36:09.940 --> 36:11.260
staring at my daughter like that

36:11.940 --> 36:13.380
seems a bit rude.

36:19.860 --> 36:20.300
No.

36:20.940 --> 36:21.380
I'm sorry.

36:21.380 --> 36:23.220
I just thought of some related cases.

36:23.500 --> 36:23.820
Right.

36:30.540 --> 36:31.620
You're wearing nail polish.

36:36.540 --> 36:38.500
I got a marker on it.

36:39.260 --> 36:40.300
Don't lie to me.

36:40.780 --> 36:41.580
I can tell.

36:41.700 --> 36:43.220
What is it, some kind of gel?

36:43.340 --> 36:44.610
It won't even scratch off.

36:44.610 --> 36:45.060
Mom.

36:46.177 --> 36:47.100
A colleague bought it

36:47.340 --> 36:48.700
and tested the color on me.

36:48.700 --> 36:49.420
Which colleague?

36:49.900 --> 36:50.500
Tell me.

36:51.060 --> 36:52.100
I need a word with her.

36:52.820 --> 36:54.380
She's a bad influence on you.

36:55.380 --> 36:55.980
We must

36:56.420 --> 36:57.020
always be

36:57.980 --> 36:59.460
upright people.

36:59.940 --> 37:00.940
Especially girls.

37:01.140 --> 37:02.660
A well-raised girl

37:02.940 --> 37:03.740
shouldn't focus

37:03.740 --> 37:05.420
on things like this.

37:05.420 --> 37:05.900
Right?

37:07.380 --> 37:07.780
This is

37:07.980 --> 37:08.620
unintentionally

37:09.020 --> 37:10.700
tempting to men.

37:11.140 --> 37:12.540
You could even call it seduction.

37:12.780 --> 37:13.580
Right, Mr. Bei?

37:15.220 --> 37:16.900
But I wiped it off right after testing.

37:17.020 --> 37:17.340
See?

37:17.740 --> 37:18.844
My other fingers are clean.

37:25.620 --> 37:27.460
Could you two please wait outside?

37:31.220 --> 37:31.860
Tell me.

37:32.340 --> 37:34.340
Did you secretly

37:34.900 --> 37:35.940
paint your toenails, too?

37:41.580 --> 37:42.100
Ms. Zhou.

37:42.340 --> 37:43.140
Later on,

37:43.380 --> 37:44.660
you need to visit our firm.

37:44.820 --> 37:45.700
We need to talk.

37:46.060 --> 37:46.620
Then,

37:46.860 --> 37:48.340
we have to meet your father.

37:48.620 --> 37:50.460
Please wait outside first.

37:53.500 --> 37:54.340
Take off your shoes.

37:55.460 --> 37:56.140
You do it,

37:56.660 --> 37:57.540
or I'll do it for you.

38:15.500 --> 38:18.420
(Changchun Apartments)

38:33.200 --> 38:34.300
I could get you the shoes.

38:34.580 --> 38:35.060
Forget it.

38:35.266 --> 38:35.940
Where's Mr. Bei?

38:36.380 --> 38:36.980
In the car.

38:37.820 --> 38:38.260
Careful.

38:57.780 --> 38:58.300
Sorry.

38:59.260 --> 39:00.980
You shouldn't have seen that.

39:03.180 --> 39:03.980
I'm a lawyer.

39:04.780 --> 39:05.730
Believe me,

39:05.730 --> 39:07.420
I've seen all kinds of clients.

39:07.755 --> 39:08.860
No, I just never thought

39:08.860 --> 39:10.660
this would happen to you.

39:13.260 --> 39:14.340
Shows you're still young.

39:15.580 --> 39:17.060
You have a lot to learn from Mr. Bei.

39:22.780 --> 39:23.620
Let's get you home.

39:26.100 --> 39:26.380
Okay.

39:32.780 --> 39:33.860
Growing up like that,

39:35.380 --> 39:37.580
and still becoming
the Zhou Mei we know,

39:38.780 --> 39:39.620
is truly remarkable.

39:55.020 --> 39:56.380
My mom was a top student.

39:58.260 --> 39:58.860
A prodigy.

39:59.700 --> 40:01.020
An apple of everyone's eyes.

40:03.020 --> 40:04.180
When my dad married her,

40:04.700 --> 40:06.660
he said he loved her brilliant mind.

40:07.540 --> 40:08.580
But when they divorced,

40:09.460 --> 40:10.940
he said she was boring.

40:12.780 --> 40:13.580
So your dad

40:13.820 --> 40:14.860
found a new wife.

40:15.140 --> 40:15.860
A mistress.

40:16.260 --> 40:17.100
Not a new wife.

40:21.940 --> 40:23.580
My mom knew where she lived.

40:25.420 --> 40:26.533
She took me there with her.

40:27.380 --> 40:30.340
(Year 2004)

40:40.844 --> 40:42.088
She acted just like

40:42.180 --> 40:43.540
what you saw earlier.

40:46.940 --> 40:47.420
And...

40:48.060 --> 40:48.660
What about you?

40:49.180 --> 40:49.660
Me?

40:58.600 --> 40:59.660
You wouldn't believe it.

41:01.940 --> 41:02.711
I was mesmerized.

41:04.220 --> 41:05.260
Every inch of her house

41:05.940 --> 41:06.980
was beautiful.

41:09.780 --> 41:10.700
Of course, I hated her.

41:12.460 --> 41:13.380
She stole my dad.

41:14.380 --> 41:16.420
She caused us
so much pain and humiliation.

41:19.180 --> 41:20.060
But at the same time,

41:21.660 --> 41:23.180
I really loved her clothes.

41:23.980 --> 41:24.780
Her jewelry.

41:26.860 --> 41:27.580
Even

41:28.300 --> 41:29.460
the smell of her house.

41:49.340 --> 41:52.300
♪My heart is beating still♪

41:53.420 --> 41:56.340
♪Sometimes I feel alone♪

41:57.100 --> 42:00.180
♪But love should not be frail♪

42:04.740 --> 42:08.060
♪Is there a spell♪

42:08.500 --> 42:11.540
♪that lies inside my head♪

42:11.980 --> 42:15.660
♪Stand naked and haunted♪

42:18.340 --> 42:19.940
♪If there's a way♪

42:19.940 --> 42:24.900
♪To save me from the blue days♪

42:25.900 --> 42:26.660
♪I guess♪

42:26.660 --> 42:31.900
♪It's rising from my silence♪

42:33.500 --> 42:35.980
♪I'm nothing but the one♪

42:35.980 --> 42:40.100
♪Who paints the blue sky♪

42:41.180 --> 42:42.780
♪With all of my tears♪

42:42.780 --> 42:44.460
♪And past pain♪

42:44.740 --> 42:46.700
♪I'd still try♪

42:49.940 --> 42:53.420
♪Please stay with me♪

42:54.020 --> 42:57.460
♪I could've held you in my arms♪

42:58.020 --> 43:00.260
♪When I said love♪

43:00.260 --> 43:03.260
♪Hurts somehow♪

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
